  <element>
    <id>UMLSequenceAllInOne</id>
    <coordinates><x>20</x><y>20</y><w>1190</w><h>510</h></coordinates>
    <panel_attributes>title=F05-F07 as implemented
obj=User~User actor
obj=DashboardView / CliApp~UI
obj=WealthSeiFacade~F
obj=AnalyticsService~AN
obj=ForecastEngine / SafeToSpendCalculator / HabitAnalyzer / HealthScoreCalculator~ENG
obj=Summary templates~TPL
obj=AgentController (only if the user asks in the Assistant)~AG
User-&gt;UI : open dashboard, or safe / forecast / habits / score
UI-&gt;F : getSafeToSpend / getForecast / getHabits / getHealthScore
F-&gt;AN : same call (today, month)
AN-&gt;ENG : compute from saved plan, transactions, goals, budget
ENG-&gt;&gt;AN : numbers (deterministic)
AN-&gt;TPL : write(result)
TPL-&gt;&gt;AN : fixed-template sentence
AN-&gt;&gt;F : result + text
F-&gt;&gt;UI : shown as numbers and text
UI-&gt;F : ask(question)
F-&gt;AG : handle(CHAT)
AG-&gt;AN : tool calls (forecast / insights tools)
AG-&gt;&gt;UI : model wording, every figure grounded against the tool results</panel_attributes>
    <additional_attributes/>
  </element>
</diagram>
